                        <p class="span">Running Campaigns using PPC that do not have an effective optimization strategy can quickly eat up the advertising funds. An PPC Consultant helps ensure your campaigns are targeted at those with higher likelihood of conversion.</p>
                        <p class="span">The strategy could include:</p>
